Every business owner we talk to says the same thing: "We should probably be doing more video." They say it the way people talk about flossing — with the vague guilt of knowing it matters but never quite getting around to it. Here's the thing we've learned after more than a decade of producing video for local and regional businesses: video isn't just one more box to check in your marketing plan. It's the single hardest-working asset you can create, because it does the job of every other piece of content at once.

