## Why Most of Your Website Visitors Never Come Back on Their Own

Very few people buy on their first visit. They're comparing options, checking prices, reading reviews, or browsing on their lunch break. Then life gets in the way. The kids need dinner, a meeting starts, or a competitor's ad catches their eye.

