## What Retargeting Is (and How It Differs From Regular Display Ads)

Retargeting, sometimes called remarketing, shows your ads to people who have already interacted with your business. That might be a visit to your website, a look at a specific service page, or engagement with your social content.

Regular display advertising works differently. It puts banner, image, or video ads in front of new audiences across websites and apps, based on interests, demographics, or the content they're viewing.

